* Tue Aug 25 2026 Steven Pritchard <steve@sicura.us> - 0.1.0
- Initial release
- Installs the `rng-tools` package by default (`rng-tools5` on Debian/Ubuntu)
- Optionally manages the `rngd` service (`rng-tools` on SLES); the service is
  left unmanaged unless `rngd::service_ensure` and/or `rngd::service_enable`
  are set
- Replaces `pupmod-simp-haveged`
